flight_vis — pilot tracker for flying clubs
===========================================

This application is derived from Traccar Client
(https://github.com/traccar/traccar-client), copyright Anton Tananaev,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See LICENSE.txt.

Upstream base commit for this fork: 94dd73f16b00c37cf1a527925efe91e60d3b856f
(https://github.com/traccar/traccar-client/commit/94dd73f16b00c37cf1a527925efe91e60d3b856f)

Modifications include rebrand to flight_vis (cl.heavenly.flightvis), removal of
third-party telemetry, club pilot login / device pairing / check-in / flight
start-stop flow against the flight_vis server, and CI packaging for Android
release builds.

Third-party components
----------------------

- traccar_client_sdk (https://pub.dev/packages/traccar_client_sdk) — location
  tracking and OsmAnd/Traccar protocol upload. Refer to the package license on
  pub.dev.

- mobile_scanner (https://pub.dev/packages/mobile_scanner) — BSD-3-Clause — QR
  barcode scanning for club check-in and device pairing.

Other dependencies are listed in pubspec.yaml with their respective licenses.